{"login": "eromeroc97", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "d6cb404072f428a022cb07ea26284cc1b44592a1", "message": "Add i18n, theme hook, new pages & UI components\n\nIntroduce language support and persistent theme handling: add useLanguage and useThemeMode hooks (localStorage persistence), plus a translations file (en/es). Replace temporary Home/About placeholders with full Home and About pages that consume translations. Add LanguageToggle component (framer-motion) and update Navbar/MainLayout/App to pass language, toggle and translation props, enable smooth-scrolling for section links, and include both theme and language toggles. Export getDesignTokens from theme and use createTheme in the hook to derive MUI theme.", "created_at": "2026-02-06T09:16:23Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3a783416913b6c5793c2c6eb9078491b2d38108a", "message": "Add MUI layout, theming, and routing structure\n\nIntroduces a custom Material UI theme, a responsive MainLayout with Navbar and Footer components, and a ThemeToggle for dark/light mode. Sets up React Router for navigation and refactors App.jsx to use the new layout and theming. Adds dependencies for react-router-dom and updates package files accordingly.", "created_at": "2026-01-21T06:41:47Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c834bb3e686c5cf3537571132e6af8d1d59ddab5", "message": "Add MUI, Emotion, and Framer Motion dependencies\n\nAdded @mui/material, @mui/icons-material, @emotion/react, @emotion/styled, and framer-motion to project dependencies in package.json and package-lock.json to enable Material UI components, Emotion styling, and animation support.", "created_at": "2026-01-21T05:50:02Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "588a758f22bcfcd4765efb646999961d26976881", "message": "Add package-lock.json and update dependencies\n\nAdded package-lock.json to lock dependency versions and updated dependencies in package.json. This ensures consistent installs and improved dependency management.", "created_at": "2026-01-21T05:47:01Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f2e50bc28e2874a9c4e99ca30a6799d663bf7171", "message": "Initialize React app with Vite and ESLint setup\n\nSet up a new React project using Vite, including initial configuration files, ESLint setup, and example source files. Added basic styling, assets, and documentation to provide a starting point for development.", "created_at": "2026-01-21T05:45:59Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "08bbd8803c7eec2eed9e4e0444d50222c3a91df9", "message": "Limpieza de proyecto para migraci\u00f3n a React v2", "created_at": "2026-01-21T05:41:16Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "773a24ca21eaf60fe0737ee43b8fa5ef2651081f", "message": "Add new memory management questions to ssoo.json\n\nAdded several new questions related to memory management concepts, including segmentation, paging, MMU, address translation, and dynamic loading. These additions expand the test coverage for operating systems topics.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:38:23Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b5ab468abec814e69e66c50f004e993c26c45bfb", "message": "Add SSOO test data and update deduplication logic\n\nAdded SSOO questions to tests/asignaturas.json and created tests/ssoo.json with extensive content. Updated find_duplicates.py to deduplicate questions within each tema instead of globally and changed output path logic. Added related images for SSOO questions.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:00Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab76ebba98eab29dca82c25e2e8109d13ab5013c", "message": "Add script to find and remove duplicate questions\n\nIntroduces find_duplicates.py, a utility to identify duplicate questions in a JSON file by canonicalizing their content (excluding 'imagen'), reporting duplicates, and generating a deduplicated output. The script outputs a report and a new JSON file with duplicates removed.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:05:39Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "05fe82ae20866374258ddc60ecbd321b74884187", "message": "Delete loveApp.html", "created_at": "2025-05-22T12:29:31Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b956176c20d0345025fcc7805867b2d0fc0a3f46", "message": "Update loveApp.html", "created_at": "2025-05-22T11:06:05Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "61dd63dc62fbb6edd8bd234912c8f83fd9d89b7a", "message": "Create loveApp.html", "created_at": "2025-05-22T11:01:59Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "79865a39e02fa141077ef042f6335f04f79aa0f7", "message": "Update dsw.json", "created_at": "2025-05-13T15:49:46Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "98f0a5e4d3a527aa6c69ccd3099fc1e0138144a8", "message": "preguntas dsw -sec taller 1", "created_at": "2025-05-13T15:37:19Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "585ceeaa6d0eeec2bd767c3db1129604a6e5ee34", "message": "Actualizacion: tests sobre \"seguridad en dise\u00f1o software\"", "created_at": "2025-05-13T15:15:52Z", "repo": "eromeroc97.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"